  "_note": "Locations, ladders, zipline, doors, abilities and the task table were checked on 2026-10-22 against among-us.fandom.com (The_Fungle, Meeting_Room, Vent_(object), Tasks list table, Visual_tasks, Vitals, Admin_(ability)) and Pocket Tactics / allthings.how (three vent chains). NO VISUAL TASKS and NO ADMIN TABLE on The Fungle. VENTS: the three systems are confirmed by the per-location wiki pages (Beach, Splash_Zone, Laboratory, Jungle, Kitchen, The_Cliffs, Communications, Reactor) and Pocket Tactics; the only open point is naming - Pocket Tactics calls the two beach vents Cafeteria and Storage, so those rooms are included in system 1 (over-inclusive, see the vent note). The wiki vent TABLE row \"Communications\" is the clifftop vent outside its lower door. ADJACENCY is my reading of the wiki map image: Beach is the open sand around the campfire and joins Dropship, Cafeteria, Splash Zone, Storage, Meeting Room, Kitchen and the Jungle; the Jungle is the big mushroom area; two ladders lead from the Jungle up to The Cliffs, another ladder from the cliffs to Communications; the zipline joins Storage and Communications (fast down, slower up - averaged). Travel seconds are eyeballed at speed 1.0x and unverified; the Fungle is large, so they are larger than on the other maps. Keys: b Beach, d Dropship, c Cafeteria, z is reserved so Splash Zone = x, t Storage, n Meeting Room, y The Dorm, i Kitchen, p Dock (pier), j Jungle, l Laboratory, g Greenhouse, r Reactor, h The Cliffs (heights), o Mining Pit (ore), w Lookout (watch), u Upper Engine, q Communications.",
